<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Sugar Ray Robinson returns eleven weeks after intake with his care partner, two weeks after his preventive visit. He has taken donepezil 5 mg at bedtime for five weeks without nausea, diarrhea or dizziness. Off glipizide, his home glucose readings run 120 to 170 mg/dL with no low readings. The hearing aids help most in conversation. He started the adult day program two days a week and likes the exercise group. The dilated eye examination booked after intake was missed: the clinic called the day before, but nobody at home remembered on the morning, and he no longer drives himself. He would like his Tdap today. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Donepezil</td><td>5 mg for five weeks; no side effects</td></tr><tr><td>Hemoglobin A1c</td><td>6.9%, from 6.4%</td></tr><tr><td>Home glucose</td><td>120 to 170 mg/dL; no lows</td></tr><tr><td>Hearing aids</td><td>Worn daily</td></tr><tr><td>Eye examination</td><td>Missed</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

